<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n77411" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πᾰνηγῠρ-ίζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>celebrate</i> or <i>attend a public festival</i>,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πανηγύριας π.</span>
			<i>keep holy-days</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.59
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ὀλύμπια καὶ Κάρνεια π.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.873e
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν τῶν ἐπινικίων ἡμέραν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>POxy.</u>
					705.35
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii A. D.)</span>: abs., <i><span class="en">
				<u>PSI</u>
				4.374.15
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ἐς πόλιν</span>
			<i>go</i> to a city <i>to attend a festival</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdn.
				1.9.2
			</span></i>: metaph., <i>enjoy oneself</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Alex.
				219.17
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>VH</u>
				13.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>frequent fairs</i> or <i>markets</i>, <i><span class="en">
				App.
				<u>Pun.</u>
				116
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> later,
				<i>make a set speech in a public assembly, deliver a
			panegyric</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				5.13
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.802e
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, <i>sound as at a festival</i>, of flutes, etc., <i><span class="en">
				Heraclit.
				<u>All.</u>
				9
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
